      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771473141748,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Coffee Roullet \n\nApi\n1. gateway\n2. user service \n3. match service\n4. Points Service",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The Coffee Roullet \n\nApi\n1. gateway\n2. user service \n3. match service\n4. Points Service",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "i0MPXn6-T3YrYn6CF6LGE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 501.03515625,
      "y": -140.23828125,
      "width": 667.9595336914062,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 931891047,
      "version": 694,
      "versionNonce": 324730695,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771474227658,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement\n1. User mgmt - Register and set availabilities\n2. Roullet engine \n    - auto gen pairs once a week\n    - two emp from diff dept \n    - System will assign a ice breaker challenge\n        - if time permits - the roullet engine will crawl the \n          social profiles of the matched emp and find the intersection\n          of their interest and assign the challenge based on those\n3. Match reveal & interaction\n    - once match found, both emp will b notified\n    - Match screen displays the partner's info and countdown timer\n4. Game\n    - Pair can upload selfie\n    - system will awards coffee points\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n1. User mgmt - Register and set availabilities\n2. Roullet engine \n    - auto gen pairs once a week\n    - two emp from diff dept \n    - System will assign a ice breaker challenge\n        - if time permits - the roullet engine will crawl the \n          social profiles of the matched emp and find the intersection\n          of their interest and assign the challenge based on those\n3. Match reveal & interaction\n    - once match found, both emp will b notified\n    - Match screen displays the partner's info and countdown timer\n4. Game\n    - Pair can upload selfie\n    - system will awards coffee points\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3j6njJ73EUFrMkztwvxXC",
      "type": "text",
